{"title":"Career Roadmap · Video Editor","role":"Video Editor","summary":"A Video Editor transforms raw footage, audio, graphics, and visual assets into a coherent finished video. The role combines storytelling, pacing, editing theory, sound, colour, motion graphics, visual effects, technical post-production, and client communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Film & Video Communication"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Editing principles + storytelling"}],[{"text":"Technical Skills"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Professional editing + sound + colour"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Motion graphics + advanced post-production"}],[{"text":"Industry Preparation"},{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Real projects + showreel + internship"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Video Editor / Assistant Editor"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Video Editor / Specialist Editor"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Senior Editor / Post-Production Lead"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Editing Supervisor / Post-Production Manager"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Creative Director / Post-Production Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Editing Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of visual storytelling."},{"type":"h","text":"Editing principles"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Continuity"},{"text":"Cutting"},{"text":"Shot selection"},{"text":"Pacing"},{"text":"Rhythm"},{"text":"Montage"},{"text":"Match cuts"},{"text":"Jump cuts"},{"text":"Cross-cutting"},{"text":"Parallel editing"},{"text":"Transitions"},{"text":"